# -*- encoding: utf-8 -*-
# Arc: Other | Scene: RazaphelQuestionsMage

translate fr strings:

    old "What is the hollow world?"
    new "Quel est le monde creux ?"

    old "A murderer and his victim, would equally go to the same place."
    new "Un meurtrier et sa victime iraient tous deux au même endroit."

    old "Where are the Gods now?"
    new "Où sont les dieux ?"

    old "A group of soldiers blocked the road up ahead of her."
    new "Un groupe de soldats bloquait la route devant elle."

    old "A few wobbled about, clearly drunk."
    new "Quelques-uns chancelaient, manifestement ivres."

    old "Fight your way out"
    new "Sortir à la force"

    old "A haunting blue light had drowned out all other light."
    new "Une lumière bleue effrayante avait noyé toute autre lumière."

    old "A moment longer, and her heart began to race."
    new "Un instant de plus, et son cœur commença à battre la chamade."

    old "Stay hidden"
    new "Rester cachée"

    old "Wait longer"
    new "Attendez un peu plus"

    old "Kill the soldiers"
    new "Éliminer les soldats"

    old "Let them have their way"
    new "Laissez-les faire"
